  "name": "vlabench_primitive_pretrain_lerobot",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDatacard\n\t\n\nThis is the official VLABench primitive pretraining dataset converted to the\nLeRobot format. The dataset contains language-conditioned manipulation\ntrajectories collected with a Franka Panda robot in VLABench simulation.\nThis LeRobot version is hosted at:\nhttps://huggingface.co/datasets/VLABench/vlabench_primitive_pretrain_lerobot\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSource\n\t\n\n\nProject Page: https://vlabench.github.io/\nArxiv Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.18194\nCode:\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/VLABench/vlabench_primitive_pretrain_lerobot.",
